From cd5b197a3dbe3dbec1ee03133c4d7182d73e7d6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: grubbychicken <ben@grbychkn.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 18:29:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ML4 M3 D2/D3: Mistral Large 4 DSpark draft head behind the
 DFlash2 interface

- runtime/ml4_dspark.cuh: the head (the pack author s TensorFold port, recipe docs/PORT.md section 9) on the TP4 split
  of tools/ml4_dspark_pack.py: taps after layers 1/18/36/54/71, target_projection + gather, per draft layer the MLA-style
  keys / values (YaRN rope) in a 4096-row ring, the 3-row block (bonus + 2 masks) through 3 layers with all-reduces,
  the target head + the autoregressive head with cross-rank picks; prompt-context fill steps; 10 collectives
- dflash.cuh: ML4 builds take that body, the sequence is shared; module_info: ML4 block 4 / 3 drafts, DFLASH2 cap
- s2_batch.h: DFL_B is the planner ABI (8), a smaller drafter block fills its first rows

Checked: full model on the ring, code-edit prompt, 400 greedy tokens, --dflash-k 3: 2.38 of 3 drafts accepted a round
(the recipe reference D0: 2.43), 28.4 tok/s over the rounds without graphs (verify 108.9 ms + draft 8.7 ms); output
equal to plain decoding for 360 tokens, then a near-tie (verify is not row-exact yet).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
